  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — namely, that Lottery B is more right-skewed due to a higher probability (80%) of the unfavorable outcome (0 Euros) compared to Lottery A (75%) — is not mentioned in the verbal report. The individual does not discuss skewness, nor do they refer to the distribution of probabilities in terms of unfavorable vs. favorable outcomes. Instead, the justification is based on the higher sum and a perception of the worst-case scenario being neutral. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason about skewness. The reasoning described does not align with the rule of the decision reason. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
